  "description": "Native UI for Cordova, with standard HTML and optional Ionic theme integration.",
  "headline": "Bring Native UI to your Cordova app",
  "overview": "Install the published adapter in your native and Web projects, start after deviceready, and keep Web fallback behavior on unsupported controls. Capacitor and Cordova share Core, but their host integrations and support scopes differ.",
